<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle questions further coffee rally.</title>
<headline>Nestle questions further coffee rally.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle SA, a major buyer of coffee on the world markets, questioned whether the recent rally in the prices of milds would continue.</p>
<p>&quot;The question is really if this extreme rise in the milds can continue in this form. Perhaps this has to be questioned if you consider that the price has practically doubled since December,&quot; Mario Corti, chief financial officer told a news conference.</p>
<p>--Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
